# Core — the borrowed fold as a typing rule  `[spec §6]`

`foldImm : !U(∀'b ⊏ ⊤. A_R ⊸ F R) ⊸ !U(∀'a ⊏ @c. Imm 'a (μX. T) ⊸ F R)` for `T` in the class
